<%- include('partials/header') %><main class="sat-page"><header class="sat-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">JDS-SAT 2026</span><h1>One aptitude test.<br><em>A bigger opportunity.</em></h1><p>Compete for merit-based scholarships on industry-oriented IT courses from Jay Dynamic Solutions.</p><a href="#register" class="btn btn-primary">Register now <i class="bi bi-arrow-down"></i></a></div><div class="sat-badge"><i class="bi bi-mortarboard"></i><b>UP TO<br>100%</b><span>scholarship</span></div></header><section class="sat-section"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">WHY JDS-SAT</span><h2>Turn potential into progress.</h2></div><div class="sat-grid"><% ['Merit-based scholarship','Industry-oriented training','Participation certificate','Hands-on projects','Expert mentorship','Internship opportunity'].forEach(item => { %><article><i class="bi bi-check-circle"></i><span><%= item %></span></article><% }) %></div></section><section id="register" class="sat-section sat-register"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">REGISTER NOW</span><h2>Reserve your place.</h2><p>Fill in your details to compete for scholarships while building industry-ready skills.</p></div><form action="/enquiry" method="post" class="form-card sat-form"><input type="hidden" name="type" value="Scholarship Registration"><input type="hidden" name="source" value="JDS-SAT"><input type="hidden" name="domain" value="JDS-SAT"><div class="form-row"><label>Full name<input name="fullName" required minlength="2"></label><label>Mobile number<input name="phone" required pattern="[6-9][0-9]{9}" maxlength="10"></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Email<input type="email" name="email" required></label><label>College name<input name="college" required></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Course<select name="course" required><option value="">Choose course</option><% courses.forEach(course => { %><option><%= course %></option><% }) %></select></label><label>Branch<input name="branch"></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>Year<input name="year"></label><label>City<input name="city"></label></div><div class="form-row"><label>State<input name="state"></label><label>Resume link <small>(optional)</small><input name="resume"></label></div><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Submit registration <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></button></form></section><section class="sat-section"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">EXAM INFO</span><h2>Simple, focused, fair.</h2></div><div class="facts"><span><b>Online</b>Mode</span><span><b>60 min</b>Duration</span><span><b>50</b>Questions</span><span><b>MCQ</b>Type</span></div><div class="sat-copy"><h3>Who can apply?</h3><p>Engineering and Polytechnic students, BCA, B.Sc Computer Science, MCA, diploma students, fresh graduates, and anyone interested in IT skills.</p><h3>Courses covered</h3><div class="pills"><% courses.forEach(course => { %><span><%= course %></span><% }) %></div></div></section><section class="sat-section faq"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span><h2>Questions, answered.</h2></div><details><summary>Is the test free?</summary><p>The final test fee policy will be announced before registration closes.</p></details><details><summary>Is scholarship guaranteed?</summary><p>Scholarship is awarded based on performance and the announced criteria.</p></details><details><summary>How will results be announced?</summary><p>Results will be announced through email and website updates.</p></details></section></main><%- include('partials/footer') %>
